#: ../../library/pyb.Flash.rst:5
msgid "class Flash -- access to built-in flash storage"
msgstr "klasa Flash -- pristup ugrađenoj flash pohrani"

#: ../../library/pyb.Flash.rst:7
msgid ""
"The Flash class allows direct access to the primary flash device on the "
"STM32-based OpenMV Cams."
msgstr ""
"Klasa Flash omogućuje izravan pristup primarnom flash uređaju na "
"STM32-baziranim OpenMV Cam kamerama."

#: ../../library/pyb.Flash.rst:10
msgid ""
"In most cases, to store persistent data on the device, you'll want to use a "
"higher-level abstraction, for example the filesystem via Python's standard "
"file API, but this interface is useful to :ref:`customise the filesystem "
"configuration <filesystem>` or implement a low-level storage system for your"
" application."
msgstr ""
"U većini slučajeva, za pohranu trajnih podataka na uređaju, poželjet ćete "
"koristiti apstrakciju više razine, na primjer datotečni sustav putem "
"Pythonovog standardnog API-ja za datoteke, ali ovo sučelje korisno je za "
":ref:`prilagodbu konfiguracije datotečnog sustava <filesystem>` ili "
"implementaciju niskorazinskog sustava pohrane za vašu aplikaciju."

#: ../../library/pyb.Flash.rst:18
msgid ""
"The OpenMV Cam **H7 Plus**, **Pure Thermal** and **N6** use an external "
"SPI/QSPI/XSPI flash chip for primary storage; the other STM32-based OpenMV "
"Cams use the internal flash inside the :term:`MCU`. The Python interface is "
"identical in both cases."
msgstr ""
"OpenMV Cam **H7 Plus**\\ , **Pure Thermal** i **N6** koriste vanjski "
"SPI/QSPI/XSPI flash čip za primarnu pohranu; ostale STM32-bazirane OpenMV "
"Cam kamere koriste internu flash memoriju unutar :term:`MCU`\\ . Python "
"sučelje je identično u oba slučaja."

#: ../../library/pyb.Flash.rst:24
msgid "Constructors"
msgstr "Konstruktori"

#: ../../library/pyb.Flash.rst:29
msgid ""
"Construct a :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev`-compatible block device for the "
"on-board flash. Two forms exist:"
msgstr ""
"Stvara blok uređaj kompatibilan s :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` za ugrađenu "
"flash memoriju. Postoje dva oblika:"

#: ../../library/pyb.Flash.rst:32
msgid ""
"``Flash()`` (no arguments): returns the legacy singleton object that exposes"
" the whole flash with a virtual partition table prepended. The actual flash "
"data starts at block ``0x100``. **This form is deprecated** and will be "
"removed in a future MicroPython release."
msgstr ""
"``Flash()`` (bez argumenata): vraća zastarjeli singleton objekt koji izlaže "
"cijelu flash memoriju s virtualnom tablicom particija dodanom na početak. "
"Stvarni flash podaci počinju na bloku ``0x100``\\ . **Ovaj oblik je "
"zastario** i bit će uklonjen u budućem izdanju MicroPythona."

#: ../../library/pyb.Flash.rst:36
msgid ""
"``Flash(start=..., len=...)``: returns a fresh block device that accesses "
"the flash starting at byte offset ``start`` (default ``0``) for ``len`` "
"bytes (default: the remainder of the device). Both values must be a multiple"
" of the underlying block size (typically 512 bytes for internal flash; the "
"external SPI/QSPI/XSPI parts use a larger erase-sector size)."
msgstr ""
"``Flash(start=..., len=...)``\\ : vraća svjež blok uređaj koji pristupa "
"flash memoriji počevši od bajtnog odmaka ``start`` (zadano ``0``\\ ) za "
"``len`` bajtova (zadano: ostatak uređaja). Obje vrijednosti moraju biti "
"višekratnici osnovne veličine bloka (obično 512 bajtova za internu flash "
"memoriju; vanjski SPI/QSPI/XSPI dijelovi koriste veću veličinu sektora "
"brisanja)."

#: ../../library/pyb.Flash.rst:44
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "Metode"

#: ../../library/pyb.Flash.rst:49
msgid ""
"Read bytes from the flash into ``buf``. Two overloads expose the simple and "
"extended interfaces:"
msgstr ""
"Čita bajtove iz flash memorije u ``buf``\\ . Dvije inačice izlažu "
"jednostavno i prošireno sučelje:"

#: ../../library/pyb.Flash.rst:52
msgid ""
"**Simple form** (``readblocks(block_num, buf)``): reads whole blocks "
"starting at block index ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` must be a multiple of "
"the flash block size."
msgstr ""
"**Jednostavni oblik** (\\ ``readblocks(block_num, buf)``\\ ): čita cijele "
"blokove počevši od indeksa bloka ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` mora biti "
"višekratnik veličine flash bloka."

#: ../../library/pyb.Flash.rst:56
msgid ""
"**Extended form** (``readblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``): reads "
"``len(buf)`` bytes -- not necessarily a whole number of blocks -- starting "
"at byte ``offset`` within block ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` has no alignment"
" constraint. Only supported on objects created with explicit ``start`` / "
"``len`` arguments, not on the deprecated singleton."
msgstr ""
"**Prošireni oblik** (\\ ``readblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``\\ ): čita "
"``len(buf)`` bajtova -- ne nužno cijeli broj blokova -- počevši od bajta "
"``offset`` unutar bloka ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` nema ograničenje "
"poravnanja. Podržano samo na objektima stvorenima s izričitim argumentima "
"``start`` / ``len``\\ , ne na zastarjelom singletonu."

#: ../../library/pyb.Flash.rst:66
msgid ""
"Write bytes from ``buf`` to the flash. Two overloads expose the simple and "
"extended interfaces:"
msgstr ""
"Zapisuje bajtove iz ``buf`` u flash memoriju. Dvije inačice izlažu "
"jednostavno i prošireno sučelje:"

#: ../../library/pyb.Flash.rst:69
msgid ""
"**Simple form** (``writeblocks(block_num, buf)``): writes whole blocks "
"starting at block index ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` must be a multiple of "
"the flash block size. Each affected block is erased automatically before "
"being written."
msgstr ""
"**Jednostavni oblik** (\\ ``writeblocks(block_num, buf)``\\ ): zapisuje "
"cijele blokove počevši od indeksa bloka ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` mora "
"biti višekratnik veličine flash bloka. Svaki zahvaćeni blok automatski se "
"briše prije zapisivanja."

#: ../../library/pyb.Flash.rst:74
msgid ""
"**Extended form** (``writeblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``): writes "
"``len(buf)`` bytes -- not necessarily a whole number of blocks -- starting "
"at byte ``offset`` within block ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` has no alignment"
" constraint, and **no implicit erase is performed** -- the caller must "
"ensure the affected blocks have been erased via a prior :meth:`ioctl(6, "
"block_num) <ioctl>` call. Only supported on objects created with explicit "
"``start`` / ``len`` arguments."
msgstr ""
"**Prošireni oblik** (\\ ``writeblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``\\ ): "
"zapisuje ``len(buf)`` bajtova -- ne nužno cijeli broj blokova -- počevši od "
"bajta ``offset`` unutar bloka ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` nema "
"ograničenje poravnanja i **ne provodi se nikakvo implicitno brisanje** -- "
"pozivatelj mora osigurati da su zahvaćeni blokovi obrisani prethodnim "
"pozivom :meth:`ioctl(6, block_num) <ioctl>`\\ . Podržano samo na objektima "
"stvorenima s izričitim argumentima ``start`` / ``len``\\ ."

#: ../../library/pyb.Flash.rst:85
msgid ""
"Standard :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` ioctl entry point. See "
":meth:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev.ioctl` for the full list of ``cmd`` values. "
"``cmd=5`` returns the flash block size in bytes; ``cmd=6`` erases the block "
"with index ``arg``."
msgstr ""
"Standardna ulazna točka ioctl za :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev`\\ . "
"Pogledajte :meth:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev.ioctl` za potpuni popis vrijednosti "
"``cmd``\\ . ``cmd=5`` vraća veličinu flash bloka u bajtovima; ``cmd=6`` "
"briše blok s indeksom ``arg``\\ ."
